{"unit_id":"tag:06L1:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>的构造，我们有交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0001>，其中<MATH_0002>是第一和第二投影（projections）。因此<MATH_0003>是光滑的（smooth），这由引理<REF_0002>推出。故 (1) 成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n若 (2) 的假设成立，则由引理<REF_0003>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是本质满射的（essentially surjective）。因此由引理<REF_0004>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>是等价（equivalence）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"projections","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"essentially surjective","target_term":"本质满射的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"所给图，译法待决"},{"source_term":"projections","target_term":"投影","context":"积的投影，译法待决"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的","context":"投影性质，译法待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所给态射，译法待决"},{"source_term":"essentially surjective","target_term":"本质满射的","context":"函子性质，译法待决"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"所给范畴等价，译法待决"}],"notes":[]}
